      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#   Overlap                                     Taught in                  Failure it produces\n\n1   Backend fetches an external API on a timer  BE W6 \u00a75 + W14 \u00a73          The entire data pipeline becomes optional\n2   Frontend queries a database directly        FE W10 RSC, W11 actions    The API contract stops being real\n3   Flyway owns schema DDL                      BE W11 \u00a77                  A migration resets the analytics schema\n4   Both compute aggregates                     BE W6 \u00a71, DE dbt marts     Two numbers for one thing, disagreeing on the demo\n5   Both build a health page                    BE W13 \u00a76, DE Streamlit    Duplicated work, neither one complete\n6   Both write CI and push images               BE W11-12, DE ACR          One workflow file, red CI on unrelated changes\n7   Both do auth                                BE W10 JWT, FE W12 \u00a73      Usually resolves itself, worth stating once",
      "originalText": "#   Overlap                                     Taught in                  Failure it produces\n\n1   Backend fetches an external API on a timer  BE W6 \u00a75 + W14 \u00a73          The entire data pipeline becomes optional\n2   Frontend queries a database directly        FE W10 RSC, W11 actions    The API contract stops being real\n3   Flyway owns schema DDL                      BE W11 \u00a77                  A migration resets the analytics schema\n4   Both compute aggregates                     BE W6 \u00a71, DE dbt marts     Two numbers for one thing, disagreeing on the demo\n5   Both build a health page                    BE W13 \u00a76, DE Streamlit    Duplicated work, neither one complete\n6   Both write CI and push images               BE W11-12, DE ACR          One workflow file, red CI on unrelated changes\n7   Both do auth                                BE W10 JWT, FE W12 \u00a73      Usually resolves itself, worth stating once",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
